    {"id":"frankincense","zh":"乳香／薰陆","latin":"Boswellia spp. resin","era":"《陈氏香谱》直接记载","molecules":[["alpha-pinene",0.55],["limonene",0.20],["sabinene",0.15],["other terpenes",0.10]],"vector":[0.35,0.90,0.15,0.05,0.35,0.25,0.65,0.05,0.15,0.00,0.25,0.75],"sources":["ctext","frankincense_gc1","frankincense_gc2","pyrfume"],"note":"不同Boswellia种与产地可由α-pinene型变为limonene/ocimene型，不能把单一样本当固定配方。"},
    {"id":"benzoin","zh":"安息香／金颜香近似树脂","latin":"Styrax benzoin / S. paralleloneurum resin","era":"《陈氏香谱》直接记载","molecules":[["benzyl benzoate",0.35],["vanillin",0.20],["benzoic/cinnamic derivatives",0.45]],"vector":[0.20,1.00,0.85,0.25,0.15,0.05,0.10,0.10,0.20,0.00,0.25,0.95],"sources":["ctext","benzoin_profile","pyrfume"],"note":"甜润香脂轮廓；金颜香身份有文献歧义，模型仅作近似候选。"},
    {"id":"borneol","zh":"龙脑／羯布罗","latin":"Dryobalanops-derived borneol; borneol/camphor family","era":"《陈氏香谱》明确同名线索","molecules":[["borneol",0.55],["camphor",0.35],["isoborneol",0.10]],"vector":[0.25,0.10,0.05,0.00,0.30,0.25,1.00,0.05,0.10,0.00,0.05,0.80],"sources":["ctext","pyrfume"],"note":"清凉、樟脑、穿透；历史龙脑来源与现代合成樟脑不可混同。"},
